{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e184f501e978451c57c3cc81b4288848abe030a9e7212e177cce1f11f16ce28f", "ja": "（39人の新人アイドルと共に、765プロとして\n新たな劇場をオープンさせる、39プロジェクト……）", "zh": "（同时推出39位新人偶像、以765艺能之名\n开设新剧场的39PROJECT……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dfab1da37395b42b5827b7e4da619d502490f6f1b379aad9d202e50dcc18d6b8", "ja": "（そんな壮大なプロジェクトを、はたして\nこのアイドルは理解してくれたのだろうか）", "zh": "（如此庞大的专案，\n这位偶像究竟能否确实理解呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "aca865b4cc5a8d4be152ed0f3ce549c88cd36d37acb9af6b07b14181bc3530c7", "ja": "ねーねー、兄ちゃん。仲間が増えるってことはー、\nボーダイでケッタイな計画を立てなきゃだよね～。", "zh": "欸欸，大哥哥，伙伴增加就代表\n要定个又大又特别的计划对吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "3b6ec2d77187257ea44d757c0ea5e8802e0e9f6229c6be52235d74466db7fb78", "ja": "劇場も広いし、何でもできちゃうよねー。何しよっか？\n鬼ゴッコ？　かくれんぼ？　亜美、困っちゃうよ～♪", "zh": "而且剧场也很大，什么事都可以做～该做什么好呢？\n鬼抓人？捉迷藏？亚美好烦恼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a9e387c81d50df7399c61ce3eabcde2fcf25a30c80969be89b62e9ba3192aeaa", "ja": "それは最終的に、俺も困っちゃうやつだな。\nそれより……。", "zh": "那样的话，到最后我也会很烦恼的。\n话说回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "82309e3eeb826e9e8a34876ec819b11ae4b6d796349450adb61a425fa6c32721", "ja": "俺は亜美にも、ちゃんと39プロジェクトのサポートを\n頼みたいんだ。引き受けてくれるか？", "zh": "我也想拜托亚美帮忙支援39PROJECT。\n你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "972387739c453b0acc45414b2904b91e1a235f2308107d832c34c6033b66b941", "ja": "もちのロンだよ、兄ちゃん！\n亜美に任せれば、39カクレンボは大成功間違いなし！", "zh": "那是当然啊，大哥哥！\n只要交给亚美，39捉迷藏保证会大成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "ead85e2e09d1c093dfa04986f07198c4c349ed4ee047969a08e6d81170311051", "ja": "オニは兄ちゃんね。よろよろー♪", "zh": "大哥哥就来当鬼吧，拜托拜托啦──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "be4cdb9e55f25dd59f38728b8ebf75fbac77db663014c6fd306ce221c21001aa", "ja": "いろいろ混ざってるぞ……。カクレンボじゃなくて、\n亜美に後輩ができるって話なんだけど。", "zh": "你把很多东西混在一起了呢……不是捉迷藏，\n我是在说亚美你要有后辈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "93c809297cfaa8f5e10299ad9b907517e964738bfe805d1126867a20baad4e2f", "ja": "やだなー、わかっておるぞよ兄ちゃん君！\n吾輩を誰だと思っているのかね！？", "zh": "讨厌啦～亚美知道喔，亲爱的大哥哥！\n你以为本人是什么人啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c0dca05ce3e998335fca6292f5a68709ae7e68060ce631bf8f09b0ff8a1100ab", "ja": "……誰なんだ？", "zh": "……是什么人啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "a2b5fd3e39a96b853a0242d6109e3d08b6498f01773aa134f69d48e7c66b4e2f", "ja": "よくぞ聞いてくれた！　亜美こそは、\nこの劇場の地下に鉄仮面で封印された双子の片割れ！", "zh": "问得好！这间剧场地下的铁面具封印着双胞胎，\n而亚美就是其中一人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "838dd339280050b030f2246d673b7442b5af1ffed283c88a8ecd3b10b33e3507", "ja": "ハッコーの美少女・双海亜美とは、亜美のことだよー！\nピッカーン！　まぶしい！　まぶしいよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "发光美少女‧双海亚美，就是在说亚美喔──！\n霹啪──！好刺眼！好刺眼喔大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95f5f82d90b9afe2ea756aa6009ca1aa84c9fea5b79c73b86f8d23460de587f1", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n発光した本人もまぶしいんだな……。", "zh": "原来是这样呀。\n发出光芒的本人也会觉得刺眼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e92f18e50d821b05e67dc04b6262bae9dd8a1a85bdd0e0c1bc9409fbca35f996", "ja": "（新しい劇場のせいか、亜美のテンションが\nいつも以上に手に負えない。こうなったら……）", "zh": "（可能因为是新剧场，让亚美的兴致比平常更高涨，\n我实在应付不来。既然如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_1015", "source_sha256": "00871452dbb415b05f34c2ab17db87cfc4c78585a234275751aae51f9176dbec", "ja": "すごいソーダ", "zh": "超厉害汽水", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cb8943d7478f3f1b13f2a46d1c7e7ffc2d40ae5590903b1c625b322566b4e3fc", "ja": "まあ、それはともかくとして。\nすごいソーダでも飲んで、落ち着いてくれ。", "zh": "对了，别说那些了。\n你先喝喝超厉害汽水，冷静下来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "6c4315d180d34019db289dac32abe5ece78b84f9fb6d13b707c3c5ffbab404d3", "ja": "うん。……ごくっごくっ。\n……ぷはぁ～、落ち着いた落ち着いた～。", "zh": "嗯。咕噜咕噜……\n……噗哈～冷静下来了冷静下来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "4681770afcf07e85d31f5ff1c6ebe86b134a893273c82844e42f9488db03e7a6", "ja": "よし。つまりだな、亜美にはアイドルの先輩として、\n後輩達のいいお手本になってもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "很好。我的意思是，希望亚美能以偶像前辈的身分，\n当后辈们的好榜样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2003_011ami", "source_sha256": "112e9a21cc69387a1202a876e3d2a03eb599a4730e290755712118624d82a00b", "ja": "うん。亜美、最初からそのつもりだよ？\n39プロジェクトって、39人も増えるんだよね？", "zh": "嗯，亚美本来就这么打算喔～\n39PROJECT的意思，是会多出39个人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "02d98fa1f8858f49e4db6f03c20af871c7353886c342d67c5e5dc6a5fde21526", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。……亜美も39プロジェクトのこと、\nちゃんと考えてたんだな。", "zh": "嗯，没错……亚美也有好好\n想过39PROJECT的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2005_011ami", "source_sha256": "203ea23daca0ae5c25379aa7612cb6b729030f364381dd46393adcf2693d637f", "ja": "そりゃそうだよー。だって友達ちょぴっとなのと\nいっぱいいるのとじゃ、遊び方が全然違うし～♪", "zh": "那当然～毕竟朋友少跟朋友多，\n玩法完全不一样嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "825ffbcc014648f64e3681e987a766a64bec0364fd45d09eac86bf58aae506bf", "ja": "ん？　遊び方……？", "zh": "嗯？玩法……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2007_011ami", "source_sha256": "bf1e15abdbe2e4409506b825f7e00814a3e7fc71cf37c44ce5dae12ea5518290", "ja": "かくれんぼとドッジボールは絶対するっしょ？\n39人でケイドロとか、メッチャ盛り上がるよね♪", "zh": "捉迷藏跟躲避球是一定要玩的吧！\n39个人玩警察抓小偷之类的﻿，一定会超热闹♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "952b9d7841aa9b12b5cb50c977e732fe29573e1a38ddb9fa467ac1945955f53e", "ja": "……遊ぶことばっかりじゃないか？", "zh": "……你是不是都在想玩的事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2009_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb92707042ddd76c058a6ec05b5ee3a1427289f867ae3575e4b759903c854b33", "ja": "あったりまえだよ兄ちゃん！\n遊ぶのに、センパイもコーハイもないよ！", "zh": "那是当然的啊，大哥哥！\n游玩的时候，没有前后辈之分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2010_011ami", "source_sha256": "6bb7e9dfbb5563bc973417875678234ee53e8a7a929395646cc7aef92027746d", "ja": "みんなで一緒に遊ぶコトで、自然とこう……\nキズナっぽいのがはぐ、はぐく、はぐくくく……。", "zh": "大家一起玩，自然而然……\n情谊之类的就会又然、有然、油然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "9290053e6b46dd9d7bd1959b1f78c0817307e3a7cd7cd439dbffba4b1d14444a", "ja": "育まれて。…つまり、亜美は自然体で行くってことか。\nまぁ、そうだよな。それが一番だ。", "zh": "油然而生……意思是亚美想自然面对是吗。\n嗯，也对，这样是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "db83507a46ca9008a500164b75415ba3524f80e1085a1a3b663d1da13ddc4ac5", "ja": "よし、亜美！　後輩達を頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好，亚美！后辈们就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2013_011ami", "source_sha256": "9c7624fe122ae45f4886d6ad2f0053cedd71185e59f0669de5bc14d250bb6e78", "ja": "イエッサー！　ばっちこいだよ、兄ちゃん！\n亜美はみんなと遊んで、メッチャ盛り上げるかんね☆", "zh": "Yes sir！放马过来吧，大哥哥！\n亚美会去跟大家玩，把气氛炒得超嗨☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2014_011ami", "source_sha256": "380aa5af9c2ddbd4ad115bec6750d71f16db9450b782ce5df6827615aa53899e", "ja": "真美～、明日のイケニエ役、決まったよ～！", "zh": "真美～明天负责当祭品的人选好啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "f7fc7bcd5aa87aa446f8b7683f955090fc2f174f7e351e93842d46879dcd2d86", "ja": "ちょっと待て！\nイケニエ役って何の話……おーい！", "zh": "等等！\n当祭品是指什么啊……喂──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_001_2016_p", "source_sha256": "d3621399efa4fbf6b7d4eec77e36f5d6efdbbf1dde519a5c71f1c0367558df15", "ja": "（亜美はいつでも亜美。その自然な姿が、\nかえって後輩達には頼もしく見えるかもしれないな）", "zh": "（亚美无论何时都是亚美。\n那自然的模样在后辈们眼中或许反而更加可靠吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
